# PBRM metallic/roughness shader.
#
# No conditions: use depends on a resolved .pbrm and the PBR workflow, which a .prog check cannot
# express; Renderer::setupProgram selects it by name (an empty list never matches the automatic scan).
#
# The vertex stage is fo4_default.vert as-is: it already supplies every varying this pass needs.

shaders fo4_default.vert pbrm_default.frag
